      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose nee Aroni giri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Barnaxes hee aa xir'imiít laqaá deei gwaa ót, laqaá hhoslit gwaa áy, nee kari tsaáhh adór tar tiqtír tsatmit, ku huwi dír Aroni, kaahamusmoó Mungú, laqaá dír garmaawós oo kaahamusmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmo dír tiqtír koom ngi xuuxuui. Barnaxes se'éngw didá' aa /awkuukúy, nee tiqti aa geehhoouúr adór ir baraá kaahartá slaqwtós i dirí', a tiqtír tsatmit. Kaahamusmoó Mungú burngwa hhe'eés xuuxuaro, kaangw gway xu'utis as heewí kuwa harmeetin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes qulhhi tam ka /awaake aa dahma hhe'eská baraá guruú kaahari, se'éngw didá' bira warqayká kuwa /awák, kaahamusmoó Mungú heedaádá' ngu paraatli deelo faanqwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál faanqw kaahamusmoó Mungú heedaádá' ngu malé ari. Barnaxes tiqtidá' aa tsiyayaaxatiká baraá kaahartós, ngu malé paraatli deelo faanqwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú heedaádá' bál faanqwe gway malé ar, axáy tiqtirós a tsiníhe, laqaá aa tsiyayaxát. Gawaá adoorihe kaahamusmoó Mungú kaangw gway oo' adór heewí kur hhoohhoó'. Gadaádá' a har deei kilós. Heedaádá' tsitaywós gway hhuunts, nee slaqwtós iri hhooeér. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá inós tiwa dír kaahamusmówí laqán kuwa hhohhoeesi, barnaxes deeidá' aa tsiyayaaxát, inós aqo in malé kii/ amór kaahamusmoó Mungú as tiwa laqan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú heedaádá' guri malé xuuxuu'. Barnaxes deeidá' heedá' gwaa altsiyayaaxát, daqaní kaahamusmoó Mungú heedaádá' guri xu'utis tawa heé ta harmeetin, asma gaa a tiqtír tsatmit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Barnaxes hee tiqtír tsatmit gwaa ót, inós ku huwi amór kaahamusmoó Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú heedá' guri xuuxuu', nee barnaxes dii aa xir'ít, nee aa /awaakuúr, nee se'éngw didá' bira /awkuukúy, nee inkaahhaydá' bir duwumiis, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "daqaní tiqtír tsatmit heesíng nguwa ót aa tlík, kaahamusmo ngu xu'utis tawa heé ta harmeetin. Gár ngus dirkaárií qaasi as nguwa alqaytsimiiti i káhh, asma heesíng aa qaroó meetagwaá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes tiqtír tsatmit slaqwtá heedá' gaa ót iimír ságwá tleemu ay tsa/oó yaae ar adoodá' kaahamusmoó Mungú ngira ari, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "daqaní kaahamusmoó Mungú heedaádá' ngu xuuxuui, nee barnaxes tiqtír tsatmit slaqwtá heedá' gaa aleetsát, inós ngu xu'utisi tawa heé aa hhoohhoouy baraá tiqtirose, asma slaqwtós sleémeero iwa /awaakuúr inós aa hhoohhooúy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala inkaahhoó duwumiís bir baraá slaqwtá heedá', daqaní heedaádá' ku harmeetin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú inkaahhaydá' duwumiís ngu xuuxuui, heedaádá' ngu xu'utisi tawa heé ta harmeetin. Gár kus harmeetin a inkaahhaydá' duwumiís, asma a tiqtír tsatmit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes inkaahhaydá' duwumiís aa warqáy, iri /awaakúy, heedaádá' i ki/i amór kaahamusmoó Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee kaahamusmoó Mungú heedaádá' ngu xuuxuui. Barnaxes didaádá' aáng tiiq aa /awakuúr, ngu xu'utisi tawa heé aa hhoohhoouy, nee daqaní inós aa hhoohhooúy,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Barnaxes hee umaangw gwaa óh nee iri hunguú/, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ala barnaxes didá' aa hungu/ aa xir'ít nee aa /awaakuúr, laqaá bira daa/atuúr nee ka /aw/awaak, daqaní ka laqan dír kaahamusmoó Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú heedaádá' ngu xuuxuui. Barnaxes ngaa ár didaádá' inkaahhaywós aa fooliít nee se'éngw didá' bira /awkuukúy, daqaní kaahamusmoó Mungú heedaádá' ngu xu'utisi tawa heé ta harmeetin, asma gaa a tiqtír tsatmit ar heedaádá' gwaa ot ar loohír umaangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes kaahamusmoó Mungú heedá' gwaa xuuxuú', nee se'éngw didá' aa /awkuukuyká nee inkaahhaay aa foolitiiká, kár ala aa xiítl, kaahamusmoó Mungú heedaádá' ngu dirkaárí qaasi deelo faanqw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes tiqtidá' aa tsiyayaaxát, kaahamusmoó Mungú ngu xu'utisi tawa heé ta harmeetin, asma gaa a tiqti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes inkaahhaydá' i doogiiginká, daqaní gaa a har mulkír umaangw, nee kaahamusmoó Mungú heedaádá' ngu xu'utisi tawa heé hhoohhoó'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
