          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Barnaxes paynuú hhawaata aa tu/uút, inós ku hhoohhoó' asma gaa a paynú ina tu/uút. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes paynú aa tu/uút iimír geeraá wá ale ay alu, heewí ku hhoohhoó', asma gaa a paynú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes gawaá paynuhe, laqaá gitse/aá heé paynuhe, kaloó sirdaa/aát naa ti'iít, gaasíng a tiqtír tsatmit guna eér, paynuúwós guna ót, laqaá gitsee/aawós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú gun xuuxuu'. Barnaxes didaádá' aa xir'ít gawaá paynuúwose laqaá gawaá gitse/aawose ka sirdaa/aat, nee a adór tiqtír tsatmit ar kaahari gaa ot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "daqaní heesíng i tiqtír tsatmituú kón. Kaahamusmoó Mungú heesíng gun xu'utis kuwa harmeetin. Tiqtirós i gawaá sagós i dirí'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
