          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Umuúqo heewo oo tiqtír tsatmituú koóm tlabaá slaxaremo gin tsitiit, nee se'eengós gu xaafiiká, nee afkós gun luu/, inós iri tseeamín iwa kaahi, ‹Aníng a baraá meeta! Aníng a baraá meeta!› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós in baraá meetaá wa hoot deelo sleémeero ar iwa tiqtír tsatmituú kon. Inós i baraá meeta, nee in tsee/aá xaftá wá hoot.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.46"
            ]
          }
        }
