          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Barnaxes deeír tsatmituú koom tlaba' gaa eér, barnaxes an tlawú taa tleéhh ar se'éngw bee/aangw, laqaá ar kitaáni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tlawusíng tam kwaa hiriít laqaá kwaa tleéhh ar kitaáni, laqaá ar se'éngw bee/aangw, laqaá a tlawuú kaahari oo umuúqo daa'awto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "barnaxes deei kaloó qaantsaár ngwaa laqaán, laqaá kaloó daa/aát gawaá tlawuwo, daqaní tlawuusíng i deeír kón. Gár kuwa hariím a kun dír kaahamusmoó Mungú i laqán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú deeír gawaá tlawuudá' gari xuuxuu', nee tlawuudá' guri dirkaárí baats deelo faanqwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál faanqwe kaahamusmoó Mungú deeidá' gari xuuxuu'. Barnaxes deeidá' aa tsiyayaaxát gawaá tlawuwo, bar an tlawuú taa hiriít laqaá oo taa tleéhh, laqaá tlawuú kaahari oo umuúqo daa'awto, tlawuusíng i deeír kón nee ku harmeetin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú tlawuudá' ngu da/i ar asla, asma gár i laqaqan a tiqtír tsatmit. Tlawuuwí aqo kun daa/, bar kuna hiriít laqaá kuna hhuútl, laqaá oo taa tleéhh ar se'éngw bee/aangw, laqaá oo kitaáni, laqaá tam oo kaahari gaalá, asma in tiqtír tsatimituú kón, tidá' tlaakw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
